WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.839
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.840 --> 02:00.040
=Episode 1=
=The Pawnshop Hero=

02:07.160 --> 02:08.440
(In the past,)

02:09.710 --> 02:12.590
(the Celestial and Demon Realms
were locked in endless conflict.)

02:13.950 --> 02:17.240
(The Six Realms suffered
untold devastation.)

02:17.860 --> 02:20.429
(The Celestial General Fei Peng
was tasked to guard)

02:20.430 --> 02:23.280
(the passage between realms,
the Celestial and Demonic Well.)

02:24.110 --> 02:26.869
(He clashed repeatedly
with the Demon Lord Chong Lou.)

02:26.870 --> 02:28.710
(Neither side
could gain the upper hand.)

02:29.840 --> 02:33.000
(On this day, they agreed to duel
in the New Immortal Realm)

02:33.110 --> 02:35.170
(to decide the victor.)

02:36.720 --> 02:39.800
(New Immortal Realm)

02:47.800 --> 02:51.320
(Demon Lord Chong Lou)

02:51.420 --> 02:52.660
Exhilarating!

02:52.900 --> 02:54.299
Across the Six Realms,

02:54.300 --> 02:56.880
only you, Fei Peng,
are worthy to be my opponent.

02:56.880 --> 02:59.160
(Celestial General Fei Peng)
Let us settle this once and for all.

02:59.460 --> 03:01.220
Just what I hoped for.

03:29.780 --> 03:32.380
As expected of Heavenly Realm's
greatest general.

03:32.900 --> 03:34.020
Fei Peng.

03:34.460 --> 03:36.660
After a thousand years of battles,

03:36.980 --> 03:38.820
you've finally gotten serious.

03:39.260 --> 03:40.380
Chong Lou,

03:41.140 --> 03:43.500
this will be our final duel.

03:43.820 --> 03:45.740
Please fight with your full strength.

03:45.780 --> 03:47.740
I don't want any regrets.

03:48.100 --> 03:49.220
Fine.

03:50.020 --> 03:51.339
If you win,

03:51.340 --> 03:55.300
I swear never to step across
the Celestial and Demonic Well again.

03:55.700 --> 03:57.780
I will not break my word.

04:39.380 --> 04:41.460
How dare you, Fei Peng!

04:41.580 --> 04:43.580
Colluding with the Demon Clan,

04:43.620 --> 04:45.540
abandoning your post without leave!

04:45.740 --> 04:48.260
Surrender at once!

04:56.620 --> 04:58.420
Criminal god Fei Peng,

04:58.660 --> 05:00.859
you were entrusted by Heaven and Earth

05:00.860 --> 05:03.099
to guard the Celestial and Demonic Well,

05:03.100 --> 05:06.260
yet you abandoned your duty
to duel the Demon Lord in private.

05:06.580 --> 05:08.379
You lost the Divine Sword.

05:08.380 --> 05:10.260
For all these crimes combined,

05:10.420 --> 05:12.100
you are sentenced to reincarnation,

05:12.140 --> 05:15.020
to suffer eternal torment
by blade and war.

05:19.860 --> 05:20.980
No!

05:21.080 --> 05:24.480
(Jing Tian, worker of Yong'an Pawnshop)

05:25.100 --> 05:26.700
That dream again.

05:28.060 --> 05:29.620
(What was that sound?)

05:32.180 --> 05:33.300
(A thief!)

05:49.180 --> 05:50.780
How dare you, thief! I...

05:59.980 --> 06:01.460
Who are you calling a thief?

06:01.580 --> 06:02.619
A female thief?

06:02.620 --> 06:03.619
I don't have any money.

06:03.620 --> 06:04.540
If you want my life,

06:05.100 --> 06:06.500
I won't give that either!

06:07.820 --> 06:09.700
Open your eyes and take a good look.

06:10.220 --> 06:12.870
I am the owner of this pawnshop's owner,

06:13.100 --> 06:14.950
the young lady of the Tang Family Fort.

06:15.460 --> 06:17.260
You're the young lady?

06:17.420 --> 06:19.220
Then I must be a Grand General!

06:24.660 --> 06:26.060
(Tang)
Look carefully.

06:28.320 --> 06:29.499
(Tang)

06:29.500 --> 06:31.620
(This material is extremely expensive.)

06:32.060 --> 06:33.580
(She really is the young lady!)

06:35.540 --> 06:37.219
I was blind and disrespectful.

06:37.220 --> 06:38.500
Greetings, young lady.

06:40.940 --> 06:42.740
You're worker of Yong'an Pawnshop,

06:42.900 --> 06:44.099
yet you don't even recognize me?

06:44.100 --> 06:44.820
Uh.

06:45.180 --> 06:47.380
May I ask, young lady,

06:47.570 --> 06:50.779
what brings you to our pawnshop
so late at night?

06:50.780 --> 06:52.080
I'm here to look for something.

06:53.660 --> 06:55.540
Find me a matching one.

07:01.660 --> 07:02.780
Well?

07:03.260 --> 07:04.500
Can it be matched?

07:05.060 --> 07:08.100
This begonia-red Yixing Teapot
is extremely rare.

07:09.860 --> 07:10.620
It can't be matched.

07:10.780 --> 07:11.740
It can't be matched?

07:11.780 --> 07:12.259
Hmm.

07:12.260 --> 07:13.380
It can't be matched.

07:15.700 --> 07:19.660
This teapot was a gift
from my grandpa's best friend.

07:20.140 --> 07:20.779
Wow.

07:20.780 --> 07:24.740
If my grandpa finds out it's broken,
he'll be heartbroken.

07:25.220 --> 07:27.220
(She looks pretty fierce.)

07:27.500 --> 07:29.300
(Didn't expect her to be so filial.)

07:29.540 --> 07:31.580
My grandpa is still ill.

07:31.780 --> 07:33.140
What should I do?

07:33.660 --> 07:35.580
It can't be matched,

07:35.660 --> 07:38.019
but I can glue it back together.

07:38.020 --> 07:38.870
Glue it?

07:38.940 --> 07:39.780
No way.

07:39.840 --> 07:40.979
There'll be cracks.

07:40.980 --> 07:41.900
Hey.

07:42.140 --> 07:43.739
Leave it to me.

07:43.740 --> 07:45.179
The antiques I restore,

07:45.180 --> 07:47.410
even experts can't see a trace.

07:48.670 --> 07:49.620
Fine.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.360
If you dare lie to me,

07:51.430 --> 07:52.820
I'll let you taste...

07:53.660 --> 07:54.680
An earthquake?

07:56.020 --> 07:57.060
Careful!

08:07.680 --> 08:08.970
That was close.

08:11.060 --> 08:12.260
Oh no!

08:21.980 --> 08:23.180
Are you alright?

08:24.640 --> 08:25.900
I'm fine.

08:26.280 --> 08:27.290
Doesn't hurt much.

08:29.300 --> 08:31.060
This iron caltrop

08:31.350 --> 08:32.780
is poisonous.

08:32.900 --> 08:33.899
What?

08:33.900 --> 08:34.580
Then,

08:34.820 --> 08:36.229
give me the antidote, quick!

08:36.230 --> 08:37.339
I rushed out today,

08:37.340 --> 08:38.100
and didn't bring it.

08:41.060 --> 08:42.220
Ow.

08:42.980 --> 08:43.820
You...

08:44.020 --> 08:45.620
You're so vicious!

08:47.100 --> 08:47.860
Hey.

08:47.880 --> 08:49.100
Right now,

08:49.480 --> 08:50.419
I feel weak all over.

08:50.420 --> 08:51.680
- Don't scare yourself.
- My limbs are getting cold.

08:51.680 --> 08:52.499
I'm done for.

08:52.500 --> 08:53.019
I'm here.

08:53.020 --> 08:53.419
I'm dying!

08:53.420 --> 08:54.380
You're not dying.

08:55.020 --> 08:55.899
Ah.

08:55.900 --> 08:57.220
I won't die?

08:57.460 --> 08:59.260
I said you won't.

09:11.260 --> 09:12.779
Help me glue the lid back on.

09:12.780 --> 09:14.050
I'll go get the antidote.

09:18.940 --> 09:20.460
What's your name?

09:21.420 --> 09:22.540
Jing Tian.

09:23.260 --> 09:24.460
Jing as in scenery,

09:25.020 --> 09:26.220
Tian as in sky.

09:26.340 --> 09:27.940
Hey, and you?

09:28.860 --> 09:29.779
Tang Xuejian.

09:29.780 --> 09:32.040
(Young lady of Tang Family Fort,
Tang Xuejian)

09:34.420 --> 09:36.859
Tomorrow morning, meet me at
Southwest Bamboo Grove of the city.

09:36.860 --> 09:38.020
Don't be late.

09:44.600 --> 09:49.600
(Yuzhou City, Yong'an Pawnshop)

10:04.500 --> 10:07.620
Absolutely seamless.

10:23.000 --> 10:23.800
You little rascal.

10:23.800 --> 10:24.179
Ow!

10:24.180 --> 10:26.230
Trying to sneak off again?

10:27.660 --> 10:29.500
What rotten luck.

10:31.340 --> 10:33.379
Boss, you're in early today.

10:33.380 --> 10:34.140
(Zhao Wenchang)
Well.

10:34.140 --> 10:35.720
(Yong'an Pawnshop Owner, )
I'm delivering some repaired items.

10:35.720 --> 10:36.720
The customer's in a hurry.

10:36.720 --> 10:37.820
What's the rush?

10:37.980 --> 10:39.260
Come here first.

10:39.620 --> 10:42.500
Take a look at these antiques
I just acquired.

10:48.820 --> 10:49.940
How is it?

10:51.860 --> 10:52.419
It's fake.

10:52.420 --> 10:53.140
What?

10:54.420 --> 10:56.340
Then look
at this celadon incense burner.

10:58.660 --> 10:59.940
This one.

11:00.460 --> 11:01.580
How about it?

11:01.980 --> 11:03.899
Too flashy. It's also fake.

11:03.900 --> 11:04.379
What?

11:04.380 --> 11:06.099
The other three are obviously fake
at a glance.

11:06.100 --> 11:07.340
Obviously fake?

11:07.540 --> 11:08.619
No.

11:08.620 --> 11:11.220
I checked them carefully at the time.

11:11.660 --> 11:12.380
This...

11:12.940 --> 11:14.419
Boss, no need to thank me.

11:14.420 --> 11:15.099
I'm in a hurry.

11:15.100 --> 11:16.300
I'm off!

11:16.550 --> 11:17.259
You little rascal!

11:17.260 --> 11:18.149
Why are you running?

11:18.150 --> 11:20.899
Think you've grown wings?
Get back early!

11:20.900 --> 11:22.870
Be late and I'll dock your pay!

11:25.800 --> 11:28.000
(Baidu Hall, Tang Family Fort)

11:45.100 --> 11:46.660
Andrographis.

11:47.840 --> 11:49.420
Jiaozhi Jade Buddha.

11:52.980 --> 11:54.380
What's going on?

11:55.020 --> 11:56.900
I clearly remember putting it here.

11:58.420 --> 11:59.540
Oh no.

11:59.580 --> 12:02.340
I added too many ingredients
at once when mixing the poison.

12:02.740 --> 12:04.340
Now I can't remember them clearly.

12:05.980 --> 12:09.180
How am I supposed to explain this
to that guy?

12:12.740 --> 12:14.900
Let me think again.

12:22.140 --> 12:24.660
Since when was there
a wooden carving here?

12:29.300 --> 12:30.420
Grandpa.

12:31.580 --> 12:35.740
When I was little, you often took me
into the mountains to gather herbs.

12:46.700 --> 12:47.820
A secret passage?

12:53.480 --> 12:56.240
(Yuzhou, Bamboo Grove)

12:58.500 --> 13:00.139
Why isn't she here yet?

13:00.140 --> 13:01.260
Stop right there!

13:01.900 --> 13:03.259
Give my money back!

13:03.260 --> 13:04.380
Demons!

13:05.300 --> 13:06.420
Stop!

13:16.180 --> 13:17.299
Sir.

13:17.300 --> 13:19.059
What exactly is going on?

13:19.060 --> 13:20.300
Young man,

13:20.800 --> 13:25.220
that Taoist priest claimed
he could subdue demons,

13:25.420 --> 13:28.900
and cheated each of us
out of one string of coins.

13:29.660 --> 13:30.779
One string?

13:30.780 --> 13:31.619
Yes.

13:31.620 --> 13:35.620
But when he saw demons,
he ran faster than anyone.

13:36.100 --> 13:37.220
What?

13:37.460 --> 13:38.860
There really are demons?

13:39.180 --> 13:41.080
You have no idea.

13:41.360 --> 13:43.019
Up ahead on the mountain path,

13:43.020 --> 13:45.580
a whole lot of demons
suddenly appeared.

13:45.880 --> 13:48.640
At my age, this is the first time

13:48.640 --> 13:49.660
- (Oh no.)
- I've seen anything like it.

13:49.670 --> 13:51.560
(She didn't run into demons
on the way, did she?)

13:52.220 --> 13:53.610
Young man,

13:53.740 --> 13:55.980
you should head back too.

13:56.580 --> 13:57.489
Alright.

13:57.490 --> 13:58.860
Take care, sir.

14:05.780 --> 14:06.780
(Xuejian.)

14:06.940 --> 14:08.299
(You must be safe.)

14:08.300 --> 14:10.140
(I still need your antidote!)

14:11.660 --> 14:15.299
Hall Master Luo's Divine Fire Art
has reached perfection today.

14:15.300 --> 14:18.179
With this Five Poison Pearl
nurtured by an immortal beast,

14:18.180 --> 14:19.560
his divine skill will be complete.

14:19.560 --> 14:21.849
The Five Poison Immortal Beast is
a treasured relic of the Tang Family Fort.

14:21.849 --> 14:23.139
(The Five Poison Immortal Beast?)

14:23.140 --> 14:24.859
If this is discovered,

14:24.860 --> 14:26.980
how am I supposed to answer for it?

14:27.390 --> 14:29.219
- Drive that old man away.
- (That voice...)

14:29.220 --> 14:31.360
- You'll lead Tang Family Fort.
- (It sounds so familiar.)

14:31.580 --> 14:34.899
When the time comes, we Thunder Hall
will fully support you  with our firearms.

14:34.900 --> 14:36.059
(Tang Family Fort, Tang Yi)

14:36.060 --> 14:38.259
Good. That's exactly what
I was waiting to hear.

14:38.260 --> 14:39.340
(Seventh Uncle?)

14:40.220 --> 14:42.859
(Thunder Hall, Feng)
A wise man knows the wind.

14:42.860 --> 14:44.139
(Hua Ying)
You flatter me.

14:44.140 --> 14:46.939
I hear that old fellow of yours
is gravely ill,

14:46.940 --> 14:48.339
and may not have long to live.

14:48.340 --> 14:50.100
(It's calling out to me for help.)

15:00.820 --> 15:01.639
I've been poisoned!

15:01.640 --> 15:02.770
Detoxify me first!

15:03.140 --> 15:04.179
Don't be afraid.

15:04.180 --> 15:06.620
She never learned the Tang Family Fort's
true poison arts.

15:09.740 --> 15:10.779
Tang Yi!

15:10.780 --> 15:11.940
You traitor!

15:27.420 --> 15:28.280
Oh no!

15:29.980 --> 15:31.100
Come with me!

15:37.900 --> 15:39.180
Your head...

15:40.020 --> 15:40.820
Alright!

15:45.030 --> 15:45.940
Wait.

15:46.900 --> 15:48.110
Don't chase them.

15:48.230 --> 15:50.880
Without the Five Poison Immortal Beast,
they can't pass the poison tomb.

15:50.900 --> 15:53.899
Notify Hall Master Luo
to capture Tang Xuejian.

15:53.900 --> 15:56.420
Yes. I'll return at once.

15:57.540 --> 15:58.499
Miss Xuejian.

15:58.500 --> 16:00.800
(Bishan Mountain Path)

16:02.690 --> 16:03.710
Who's there?

16:18.210 --> 16:19.760
A ghost!

16:19.900 --> 16:20.859
Stop!

16:20.860 --> 16:22.100
Where do you think you're going?

16:29.540 --> 16:30.339
Don't!

16:30.340 --> 16:31.540
Don't come any closer!

16:37.700 --> 16:38.500
Uh.

16:39.820 --> 16:41.060
Who are you guys?

16:42.100 --> 16:44.540
I'm Never-Drunk.

16:45.120 --> 16:47.180
I'm Lantern Demon.

16:49.620 --> 16:52.579
I'm Grain Hermit.

16:52.580 --> 16:55.320
(Wine, Rice)

16:56.140 --> 16:58.339
Have you heard of the Shu Mountain Sect?

16:58.340 --> 17:00.019
I'm a swordsman of Shu Mountain Sect!

17:01.370 --> 17:02.859
Another impostor.

17:02.860 --> 17:03.589
Brothers!

17:03.590 --> 17:04.219
Beat him up!

17:04.220 --> 17:05.460
Yes, boss!

17:10.160 --> 17:11.379
Take this!

17:11.380 --> 17:13.500
Behold my invincible rolling attack!

17:19.220 --> 17:22.500
We should roast this lad and eat him.

17:23.060 --> 17:25.219
Drunken Blossom Frenzy!

17:25.220 --> 17:26.380
Finish him!

17:39.420 --> 17:41.699
My thousand-year aged sauce-aroma brew!

17:41.700 --> 17:42.459
Never-Drunk.

17:42.460 --> 17:43.619
Are you alright?

17:43.620 --> 17:45.460
I'll help cover your wound!

17:46.540 --> 17:49.020
Never-Drunk. From now on,

17:49.021 --> 17:51.580
we'll be known as the
Rice-and-Wine Brothers.

17:56.010 --> 17:59.180
- What kind of demon are you?
- I'm Lantern Demon.

18:00.780 --> 18:02.460
Smells so good.

18:04.620 --> 18:06.980
I think I'm burnt.

18:07.980 --> 18:08.939
Brothers!

18:08.940 --> 18:10.060
Retreat!

18:17.580 --> 18:19.020
My sword!

18:19.840 --> 18:23.160
(Tang Family Fort)

18:23.620 --> 18:27.260
It really was your young lady,
Tang Xuejian, who arranged to meet me.

18:27.420 --> 18:28.259
Look.

18:28.260 --> 18:29.459
I was hit by her poisoned dart.

18:29.460 --> 18:30.980
I came to get the antidote.

18:31.420 --> 18:33.499
If the poison kills me and I die here,

18:33.500 --> 18:35.500
wouldn't that cause trouble for you?

18:36.220 --> 18:39.580
Lad, you think Tang Family Fort
is a place you can just barge into?

18:39.920 --> 18:40.879
Sir.

18:40.880 --> 18:42.160
Please help me report this.

18:42.160 --> 18:44.800
- I have something urgent...
- Tang Xuejian is not in Tang Family Fort.

18:44.920 --> 18:45.720
Get lost.

18:48.400 --> 18:49.649
Then where did she go?

18:49.650 --> 18:51.020
What about the poison in me?

18:51.940 --> 18:53.230
Poisoned?

18:53.600 --> 18:56.960
Those poison darts she tinkers
with couldn't even kill a rat.

18:57.640 --> 19:00.239
(She wasn't really captured
by demons, was she?)

19:00.240 --> 19:02.709
(But could the demons like that)

19:02.710 --> 19:04.640
(really hurt her?)

19:19.390 --> 19:20.740
Jing Tian!

19:23.360 --> 19:25.079
You brat!

19:25.080 --> 19:27.319
All you know is slacking off.

19:27.320 --> 19:29.560
You come back only after closing time.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.159
Listen to me.

19:31.160 --> 19:32.759
I really ran into demons!

19:32.760 --> 19:33.799
Demons?

19:33.800 --> 19:34.920
From what I see,

19:35.000 --> 19:37.039
you're the demon

19:37.040 --> 19:37.799
causing trouble!

19:37.800 --> 19:38.839
I really did meet demons!

19:38.840 --> 19:40.279
I'll deal with you now,

19:40.280 --> 19:42.800
you menace!

20:11.620 --> 20:13.230
Pawn the sword.

20:34.450 --> 20:35.729
Unite sword and qi,

20:35.730 --> 20:37.200
ride the sword and soar.

20:37.450 --> 20:38.350
Rise!

20:39.900 --> 20:41.130
It worked!

20:42.120 --> 20:43.290
Jing Tian!

21:04.490 --> 21:07.769
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

21:07.770 --> 21:11.099
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

21:11.100 --> 21:14.749
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

21:14.750 --> 21:17.969
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

21:17.970 --> 21:21.139
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

21:21.140 --> 21:24.789
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

21:24.790 --> 21:28.519
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

21:28.520 --> 21:35.019
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

21:35.020 --> 21:38.469
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

21:38.470 --> 21:41.959
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

21:41.960 --> 21:45.349
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

21:45.350 --> 21:48.749
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

21:48.750 --> 21:52.139
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:52.140 --> 21:55.659
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

21:55.660 --> 21:58.989
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

21:58.990 --> 22:02.329
♪All for the sake of the living♪

22:02.330 --> 22:07.140
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

22:21.090 --> 22:22.132
(Next episode preview)
Villains are plotting

